  "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
  "body": "The launch script forces X11 mode, overriding any env variables set on the user set and making it impossible to launch in wayland mode without manually changing the launch script.\n\nI think we should read the value from the environment vars instead, or read from env vars with a fallback. This is unnecessarily hostile to wayland and wayland users.\n\n\nWe could do with removing the following line:\n\nhttps://github.com/artpixls/ART/blob/d784d8ef986938c8a6c6185d3317378bd0901e1f/tools/linux/bundle_ART.py#L334",
